            "review_text": "Reslimpan\nRayong, Thailand4155 contributions\n0\nIt’s the dish, not the restaurant\nDec 2025 • Family\nWe wanted to try Mì Quảng before leaving Da Nang and picked this place based on its Michelin recommendation. It was our first time having the dish, so maybe expectations were off—but honestly, it was pretty dull. Compared to boat noodles or khao soi in Thailand, laksa in Malaysia, beef noodle soup in Taiwan, or even a basic pho in Vietnam, this just didn’t deliver much flavor or excitement. Perfectly edible, but forgettable and not something I’d go out of my way for again.\nRead more\nWritten December 25, 2025",
