            "review_text": "hk-san\nTokyo Prefecture, Japan609 contributions\n0\nRecommendations of Me Quang\nAug 2024 • Solo\nIt tasted better than it did a year ago. The soup becomes more entwined with the noodles and is delicious. I made pork and shrimp meekwan, but pork was delicious. I feel like prices are going up every year. (Not very expensive though.)\nThe staff was doing well, and I've been cleaning the shop, and I guess I've kind of upgraded after being registered with Michelin. It was just delicious.\nI went there around 11:30, but it was moderately crowded and I could sit. Everyone eats quickly, so they spin fast.\nRead more\nTranslated from Japanese\nShow original\nWritten August 31, 2024",
