            "review_text": "tuấn anh D\nDa Nang, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nSavor Authentic Flavors at Mi Quang 1A: A 4-Star Culinary Experience\nMar 2024 • Family\nMi Quang 1A offers an exceptional dining experience, earning a solid 4-star rating from me. The restaurant impresses with its authentic flavors and hearty portions. Their signature dish, Mi Quang, is a delightful blend of flavors and textures, showcasing the richness of Vietnamese cuisine. The ambiance is cozy and welcoming, making it perfect for a casual meal with friends or family. While the service can be a bit slow during peak hours, the delicious food and reasonable prices more than make up for it. Overall, Mi Quang 1A is a must-visit for anyone craving a taste of Vietnam's culinary delights.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\ntemporarily good\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 13, 2024",
